  lines:
  - english: People used to write letters beside this lake.
    vietnamese: "Ng\xE0y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u01B0\u1EDDng
      ng\u1ED3i vi\u1EBFt th\u01B0 b\xEAn b\u1EDD h\u1ED3 n\xE0y."
  - english: A kind word can stay with someone for a long time.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t l\u1EDDi n\xF3i t\u1EED t\u1EBF c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u1EDF l\u1EA1i
      trong l\xF2ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi r\u1EA5t l\xE2u."
